# Copy to .dev.vars for local development. .dev.vars is gitignored.
# Production values are set with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
#
# Secrets are introduced in the phase that needs them:
#   Phase 3: AUTH_TOKEN_SECRET
#   Phase 5: LIVEKIT_API_KEY, LIVEKIT_API_SECRET, LIVEKIT_URL
#   Phase 6: APNS_*, FCM_*
